  "answer": "B",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$$C = \\frac{\\epsilon_0A}{d - t + t/K} = \\frac{\\epsilon_0A}{d - \\frac{d}{2} + \\frac{d}{8}} = \\frac{\\epsilon_0A}{5d/8} = \\frac{8}{5}C_0$$",
